      "uid": "zhcn:2800f6a9db4e94439f4fa9bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就连目白家的赛马娘们也被耍得团团转。\n这到底是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "696bc76e96dc4f2e5adf18c623ab988bf96ab46f9c36b58cff7578b618181140",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
